@host = http://localhost:5069

### Listele
GET {{host}}/api/students

### Ekle
POST {{host}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Ayşe", "lastName": "Yılmaz", "email": "ayse@example.com", "gradeLevel": 7 }

### Tek kayıt
GET {{host}}/api/students/1

### Güncelle
PUT {{host}}/api/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Ayşe", "lastName": "Demir", "email": "ayse@example.com", "gradeLevel": 8 }

### Geçersiz istek (400 beklenir)
POST {{host}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "", "lastName": "X", "gradeLevel": 99 }

### Sil
DELETE {{host}}/api/students/1

### Dersleri listele (konularla)
GET {{host}}/api/courses

### Ders ekle
POST {{host}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Matematik" }

### Derse konu ekle
POST {{host}}/api/courses/1/topics
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kesirler", "order": 1 }

### Konu güncelle
PUT {{host}}/api/topics/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kesirler ve Ondalıklar", "order": 1 }

### Öğrencinin ilerlemesi (tüm konular)
GET {{host}}/api/students/1/progress

### İlerleme güncelle (NotStarted | InProgress | Completed)
PUT {{host}}/api/students/1/progress/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Completed", "note": "Testten 90 aldı." }

### Konu sil
DELETE {{host}}/api/topics/1

### Ders sil (konular ve ilerlemeler de silinir)
DELETE {{host}}/api/courses/1
